Subject: [PATCH] feat(cloudflare): configurable MCP OAuth lifetimes and
 redirect allowlist

Adds four optional Worker settings. Unset, behavior is unchanged.

- OOMOL_CONNECT_MCP_OAUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS (default 3600)
- OOMOL_CONNECT_MCP_OAUTH_GRANT_TTL_SECONDS (default 2592000, fixed from code exchange)
- OOMOL_CONNECT_MCP_OAUTH_GRANT_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS (unset: fixed lifetime; set: sliding)
- OOMOL_CONNECT_MCP_OAUTH_ALLOWED_REDIRECT_URIS (comma separated; empty allows any
  registered URI; http loopback URIs match on any port)

A set lifetime below 60 seconds or not an integer fails closed with 503.
The consent page states the configured grant lifetime.

